1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,155
A black-and-white picture in color?

2
00:00:05,205 --> 00:00:07,625
Stare at the dot in the middle
of the color-flipped picture for 20 seconds

3
00:00:07,675 --> 00:00:10,495
Then a black-and-white picture appears

4
00:00:10,545 --> 00:00:19,265
Don't take your eyes off the center dot

5
00:00:19,315 --> 00:00:26,265
Just a little longer!

6
00:00:26,315 --> 00:00:31,265
Keep looking at the center dot when it ends!

7
00:00:31,315 --> 00:00:34,635
It's black and white, but do you see colors?

8
00:00:34,685 --> 00:00:38,835
Did you see these colors?

9
00:00:38,885 --> 00:00:41,205
Stare at an orange sky for a long time
and the orange-tired cells…

10
00:00:41,255 --> 00:00:43,375
paint the gray sky blue —
the grass and roof flip too!

11
00:00:43,425 --> 00:00:45,585
The gray picture gives light and dark,
the afterimage gives color

12
00:00:45,635 --> 00:00:49,585
Together they look
like a color picture!

13
00:00:49,635 --> 00:00:51,635
The afterimage trick, on a whole picture!

14
00:00:51,685 --> 00:00:54,835
NEXT: Stare at the center and the dots disappear?
